<title>POLAND: PLI lifts CP programme to PLN 50 mln.</title>
<headline>PLI lifts CP programme to PLN 50 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish retailer and wholesaler PLI SA, in conjunction with Raiffeisen Centrobank SA, has increased the nominal value of its commercial paper programme to 50 million zlotys, PLI said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>PLI, whose full name is Polish Life Improvement SA, said last May it was launching a 25-million-zloty CP programme.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
